{"content": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Why Is the Sky Blue? · 天空为什么是蓝色的？</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#f4f8fc;
    --ink:#12324f;
    --ink-soft:#4a6580;
    --card:#ffffff;
    --line:#dce7f1;
    --sky:#2b7fd4;
    --sky-deep:#123a63;
    --en-accent:#2b7fd4;
    --zh-accent:#e07a3f;
    --shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(18,58,99,.10);
    --radius:16px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI","Noto Sans SC","PingFang SC","Hiragino Sans GB","Microsoft YaHei",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
    color:var(--ink);
    background:
      radial-gradient(1200px 500px at 10% -10%, #dbeefc 0%, transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(1000px 460px at 110% 0%, #cfe6fb 0%, transparent 55%),
      var(--bg);
    line-height:1.65;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 20px 80px}

  /* Header */
  header.hero{
    text-align:center;
    padding:40px 24px 28px;
    border-radius:24px;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#3a90e0 0%,#1f63aa 60%,#123a63 100%);
    color:#fff;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  header.hero h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.6vw,2.8rem);letter-spacing:.5px}
  header.hero .zh-title{font-size:clamp(1.1rem,2.4vw,1.6rem);opacity:.92;margin-top:6px;font-weight:500}
  header.hero p{max-width:680px;margin:14px auto 0;opacity:.9;font-size:.98rem}
  .sun{position:absolute;top:26px;right:34px;width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;
    background:radial-gradient(circle at 40% 40%,#fff7cf,#ffd35b 60%,#ffb703);
    box-shadow:0 0 40px 12px rgba(255,208,80,.55);}

  /* Toolbar */
  .toolbar{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:22px 0 6px}
  .toolbar button{
    font:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:#fff;color:var(--ink);
    padding:9px 18px;border-radius:999px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    transition:transform .15s ease,background .15s ease,color .15s ease,border-color .15s;
  }
  .toolbar button:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
  .toolbar button[aria-pressed="true"]{
    background:var(--sky-deep);color:#fff;border-color:var(--sky-deep);
  }

  /* Slide nav */
  nav.levels{display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:14px 0 28px}
  nav.levels a{
    text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.86rem;
    padding:6px 14px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;
  }
  nav.levels a:hover{color:var(--sky-deep);border-color:var(--sky)}

  /* Section / slide */
  section.slide{
    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:26px 26px 30px;margin:0 0 30px;
  }
  section.slide > h2{
    margin:0 0 4px;font-size:clamp(1.2rem,2.6vw,1.7rem);color:var(--sky-deep);
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .badge{font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;color:#fff;background:var(--sky)}
  section.slide .sub{color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0 0 20px;font-size:.92rem}

  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:26px}
  .col{min-width:0}
  .col .lang-tag{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px;color:#fff;
    padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;
  }
  .col.en .lang-tag{background:var(--en-accent)}
  .col.zh .lang-tag{background:var(--zh-accent)}
  .col p{margin:0 0 14px}
  .col ul{margin:0 0 14px;padding-left:20px}
  .col li{margin:0 0 8px}
  .col strong{color:var(--sky-deep)}

  /* View modes */
  body[data-view="en"] .col.zh{display:none}
  body[data-view="zh"] .col.en{display:none}
  body[data-view="en"] .grid,
  body[data-view="zh"] .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}

  /* Math, rendered without external libs */
  .formula{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.35em;flex-wrap:wrap;
    font-family:"Cambria Math","Latin Modern Math",Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
    font-size:1.08rem;color:var(--sky-deep);
    background:#f2f7fd;border:1px dashed #bcd6f0;border-radius:10px;
    padding:10px 16px;margin:12px 0;
  }
  .frac{display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;margin:0 .15em}
  .frac .num{border-bottom:1.5px solid currentColor;padding:0 .35em}
  .frac .den{padding:0 .35em}
  .var{font-style:italic}
  sub,sup{font-size:.72em}

  /* Summary table */
  .summary{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:26px}
  .summary h2{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--sky-deep);font-size:1.3rem}
  table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.94rem}
  th,td{text-align:left;padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}
  thead th{background:#eef6fe;color:var(--sky-deep);font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase}
  tbody tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
  tbody th{color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}

  footer{text-align:center;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.82rem;margin-top:36px}

  @media (max-width:760px){
    .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    body[data-view="both"] .col.en{border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);padding-bottom:18px;margin-bottom:6px}
    header.hero{padding:32px 18px 22px}
    .sun{display:none}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body data-view="both">
<div class="wrap">

  <header class="hero">
    <span class="sun" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <h1>Why Is the Sky Blue?</h1>
    <div class="zh-title">天空为什么是蓝色的？</div>
    <p>A bilingual explanation for three audiences · 面向三种读者的双语解释</p>
  </header>

  <div class="toolbar" role="group" aria-label="Language view">
    <button data-mode="both" aria-pressed="true">Both · 双语</button>
    <button data-mode="en" aria-pressed="false">English</button>
    <button data-mode="zh" aria-pressed="false">中文</button>
  </div>

  <nav class="levels" aria-label="Sections">
    <a href="#toddler">👶 3-Year-Old · 3岁</a>
    <a href="#teen">🎒 High School · 高中生</a>
    <a href="#phd">🔬 Physics PhD · 博士</a>
    <a href="#summary">📋 Summary · 总结</a>
  </nav>

  <!-- Toddler -->
  <section class="slide" id="toddler">
    <h2>👶 For a 3-Year-Old <span class="badge">Simple</span></h2>
    <p class="sub">写给 3 岁的小朋友</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="col en" lang="en">
        <span class="lang-tag">🇬🇧 English</span>
        <p>The sky looks blue because of the sunshine!</p>
        <p>The sun sends down light that looks white, but it's actually made of lots of colors — like a rainbow hiding inside. When the light comes to Earth, it bumps into tiny little bits of air floating all around us.</p>
        <p>The blue color loves to bounce around more than the other colors. It bounces this way and that way, all over the sky, and then into your eyes. So when you look up, the whole sky looks blue to you!</p>
        <p>At night the sun goes away, so there's no light to bounce, and the sky turns dark. 🌞💙</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col zh" lang="zh">
        <span class="lang-tag">🇨🇳 中文</span>
        <p>天空看起来是蓝色的，都归功于阳光！</p>
        <p>太阳照下来的光看起来是白色的，其实里面藏着好多颜色——就像彩虹藏在里面一样。当光照到地球上，它会撞上漂浮在我们周围的、空气里那些极小极小的颗粒。</p>
        <p>蓝色比别的颜色更爱蹦蹦跳跳。它这儿一下、那儿一下，在整个天空中跳来跳去，最后跳进你的眼睛里。所以当你抬头看，整片天空看起来就是蓝色的啦！</p>
        <p>到了晚上，太阳下山了，没有光可以蹦跳，天空就变黑啦。🌞💙</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Teen -->
  <section class="slide" id="teen">
    <h2>🎒 For a High School Student <span class="badge">Rayleigh</span></h2>
    <p class="sub">写给高中生</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="col en" lang="en">
        <span class="lang-tag">🇬🇧 English</span>
        <p>Sunlight looks white, but it's a mix of all the colors of the visible spectrum (red, orange, yellow, green, blue, violet). Each color is light of a different <strong>wavelength</strong> — red is long (~700 nm), blue and violet are short (~400–450 nm).</p>
        <p>When sunlight enters the atmosphere, it hits nitrogen and oxygen molecules far smaller than the wavelength, so they <strong>scatter</strong> the light. Shorter wavelengths scatter far more — this is <strong>Rayleigh scattering</strong>, where scattered intensity goes roughly as:</p>
        <div class="formula"><span class="var">I</span> ∝ <span class="frac"><span class="num">1</span><span class="den"><span class="var">λ</span><sup>4</sup></span></span></div>
        <p>So blue light scatters in every direction much more than red, filling the sky with blue.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Why not violet?</strong> The sun emits less violet, our eyes are less sensitive to it, and the upper atmosphere absorbs some — so we see blue.</li>
          <li><strong>Why red at sunset?</strong> Low sun = a longer path through the atmosphere; most blue is scattered <em>away</em>, leaving reds and oranges.</li>
          <li><strong>Why are clouds white?</strong> Large water droplets scatter all colors equally (Mie scattering).</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col zh" lang="zh">
        <span class="lang-tag">🇨🇳 中文</span>
        <p>太阳光看起来是白色的，但它其实是可见光谱里所有颜色的混合（红、橙、黄、绿、蓝、紫）。每种颜色都是不同<strong>波长</strong>的光——红光较长（约 700 纳米），蓝光和紫光较短（约 400–450 纳米）。</p>
        <p>当太阳光进入大气层时，会碰到比波长小得多的氮气和氧气分子，因此会把光<strong>散射</strong>开来。波长越短的光被散射得越厉害——这叫作<strong>瑞利散射</strong>，散射光强度大致满足：</p>
        <div class="formula"><span class="var">I</span> ∝ <span class="frac"><span class="num">1</span><span class="den"><span class="var">λ</span><sup>4</sup></span></span></div>
        <p>所以蓝光（波长短）比红光被散射到四面八方要强烈得多，使整片天空看起来是蓝色的。</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>为什么不是紫色？</strong> 太阳发出的紫光较少，人眼对紫光不够敏感，且高层大气会吸收一部分——所以我们看到蓝色。</li>
          <li><strong>为什么日落是红的？</strong> 太阳很低时光穿过的大气更厚；大部分蓝光被散射<em>走</em>，剩下红光和橙光。</li>
          <li><strong>为什么云是白色的？</strong> 较大的水滴对各种颜色同等散射（米氏散射）。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PhD -->
  <section class="slide" id="phd">
    <h2>🔬 For a Physics PhD <span class="badge">Rigorous</span></h2>
    <p class="sub">写给物理学博士</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="col en" lang="en">
        <span class="lang-tag">🇬🇧 English</span>
        <p>The blueness of the daytime sky is a consequence of <strong>Rayleigh scattering</strong> by atmospheric molecules, modulated by the solar spectrum, human photopic response, and multiple-scattering radiative transfer.</p>
        <p>For a particle of radius <span class="var">a</span> ≪ <span class="var">λ</span> (N₂, O₂; polarizability <span class="var">α</span>), the induced-dipole differential cross-section is:</p>
        <div class="formula">
          <span class="frac"><span class="num"><span class="var">dσ</span></span><span class="den"><span class="var">d</span>Ω</span></span> =
          <span class="frac"><span class="num"><span class="var">k</span><sup>4</sup><span class="var">α</span><sup>2</sup></span><span class="den">1 + (depolarization)</span></span> · <span class="var">f</span>(θ)
        </div>
        <div class="formula"><span class="var">σ</span> ∝ <span class="var">ω</span><sup>4</sup> ∝ <span class="var">λ</span><sup>−4</sup></div>
        <p>Scattering at 400 nm is ~<span class="var">(700/400)</span><sup>4</sup> ≈ 9.4× stronger than at 700 nm. The observed radiance is the solution of the <strong>radiative transfer equation</strong>:</p>
        <div class="formula">
          <span class="frac"><span class="num"><span class="var">dI<sub>ν</sub></span></span><span class="den"><span class="var">ds</span></span></span> =
          −<span class="var">κ<sub>ν</sub>I<sub>ν</sub></span> + <span class="var">j<sub>ν</sub></span>
        </div>
        <p>The source function <span class="var">j<sub>ν</sub></span> includes single scattering of the solar beam plus multiple scattering. The Rayleigh phase function <span class="var">P</span>(θ) ∝ 1 + cos<sup>2</sup>θ shapes the angular distribution and polarization.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>The violet problem</strong> is resolved by the solar spectral irradiance, the CIE photopic function <span class="var">V</span>(λ), and the Chappuis band of ozone (O₃).</li>
          <li><strong>Aerosols</strong> with <span class="var">a</span> ~ λ add <strong>Mie scattering</strong> (<span class="var">σ</span> ∝ <span class="var">λ</span><sup>−n</sup>, 0 ≲ <span class="var">n</span> ≲ 4), flattening the spectrum — quantified by the Ångström turbidity coefficient.</li>
          <li><strong>Fraunhofer lines</strong>, ozone (Huggins/Chappuis) and water-vapor bands imprint structure relevant to colorimetry and remote sensing.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>The same <span class="var">λ</span><sup>−4</sup> physics explains the <strong>red setting sun</strong> via the Bouguer–Lambert optical depth <span class="var">τ</span> = ∫ <span class="var">κ<sub>λ</sub>ρ</span> d<span class="var">s</span>, plus blue reflection nebulae and interstellar reddening.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col zh" lang="zh">
        <span class="lang-tag">🇨🇳 中文</span>
        <p>白天天空的蓝色是大气分子发生<strong>瑞利散射</strong>的结果，并受到太阳光谱、人眼光视响应以及多次散射辐射传输的共同调制。</p>
        <p>对于半径 <span class="var">a</span> ≪ <span class="var">λ</span> 的粒子（N₂、O₂；极化率 <span class="var">α</span>），由感生偶极辐射得到的微分散射截面为：</p>
        <div class="formula">
          <span class="frac"><span class="num"><span class="var">dσ</span></span><span class="den"><span class="var">d</span>Ω</span></span> =
          <span class="frac"><span class="num"><span class="var">k</span><sup>4</sup><span class="var">α</span><sup>2</sup></span><span class="den">1 + (退偏振因子)</span></span> · <span class="var">f</span>(θ)
        </div>
        <div class="formula"><span class="var">σ</span> ∝ <span class="var">ω</span><sup>4</sup> ∝ <span class="var">λ</span><sup>−4</sup></div>
        <p>400 nm 处的散射强度约是 700 nm 处的 <span class="var">(700/400)</span><sup>4</sup> ≈ 9.4 倍。观测到的辐射亮度是<strong>辐射传输方程</strong>的解：</p>
        <div class="formula">
          <span class="frac"><span class="num"><span class="var">dI<sub>ν</sub></span></span><span class="den"><span class="var">ds</span></span></span> =
          −<span class="var">κ<sub>ν</sub>I<sub>ν</sub></span> + <span class="var">j<sub>ν</sub></span>
        </div>
        <p>源函数 <span class="var">j<sub>ν</sub></span> 既包含对直接太阳光束的单次散射，也包含多次散射项。瑞利相位函数 <span class="var">P</span>(θ) ∝ 1 + cos<sup>2</sup>θ 塑造了天空光的角分布及其偏振特性。</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>紫光难题</strong>由三个因子的乘积解决——太阳光谱辐照度、CIE 光视效率函数 <span class="var">V</span>(λ)，以及臭氧（O₃）的 Chappuis 吸收带。</li>
          <li>半径 <span class="var">a</span> ~ λ 的<strong>气溶胶</strong>引入<strong>米氏散射</strong>（<span class="var">σ</span> ∝ <span class="var">λ</span><sup>−n</sup>，0 ≲ <span class="var">n</span> ≲ 4），把光谱“压平”——用 Ångström 混浊系数描述。</li>
          <li><strong>夫琅禾费吸收线</strong>、臭氧（Huggins/Chappuis 带）及水汽吸收带叠加的光谱结构，对色度学与遥感非常重要。</li>
        </ul>
        <p>同样的 <span class="var">λ</span><sup>−4</sup> 物理，借助布格–朗伯定律的光学深度 <span class="var">τ</span> = ∫ <span class="var">κ<sub>λ</sub>ρ</span> d<span class="var">s</span>，也解释了<strong>落日的红色</strong>，以及蓝色的反射星云与星际红化。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Summary -->
  <section class="summary" id="summary">
    <h2>📋 One-line summary · 一句话总结</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Audience · 读者</th>
          <th>English</th>
          <th>中文</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <th>👶 3-year-old · 3岁</th>
          <td>Blue light bounces around the air and into your eyes.</td>
          <td>蓝光在空气里蹦蹦跳跳，最后跳进你的眼睛。</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th>🎒 Teenager · 高中生</th>
          <td>Rayleigh scattering (∝ 1/λ⁴) scatters short wavelengths more, so the sky looks blue.</td>
          <td>瑞利散射（∝ 1/λ⁴）让短波长光散射得更多，所以天空看起来是蓝色的。</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th>🔬 PhD · 博士</th>
          <td>Skylight radiance is the radiative-transfer solution dominated by molecular Rayleigh scattering (σ ∝ λ⁻⁴), weighted by the solar spectrum, photopic response, ozone absorption, and aerosol (Mie) contributions.</td>
          <td>天空光的辐射亮度是以分子瑞利散射（σ ∝ λ⁻⁴）为主导的辐射传输方程的解，并加权了太阳光谱、光视响应、臭氧吸收和气溶胶（米氏散射）的贡献。</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <footer>
    Bilingual presentation · 双语演示 — fully self-contained, no external resources.
  </footer>

</div>

<script>
  (function(){
    var buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.toolbar button');
    function setMode(mode){
      document.body.setAttribute('data-view', mode);
      buttons.forEach(function(b){
        b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', b.dataset.mode === mode ? 'true' : 'false');
      });
    }
    buttons.forEach(function(b){
      b.addEventListener('click', function(){ setMode(b.dataset.mode); });
    });

    // Keyboard shortcuts: 1 = both, 2 = en, 3 = zh
    document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){
      if(e.target && /input|textarea/i.test(e.target.tagName)) return;
      if(e.key === '1') setMode('both');
      if(e.key === '2') setMode('en');
      if(e.key === '3') setMode('zh');
    });
  })();
</script>
</body>
</html>
